00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.980
Another mirror projects a light beam to a spectroscope,

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:29.960
an instrument which splits the light.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:37.480
into its component colors. A visible spectrum. Dark lines that cut across the spectrum band

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:42.520
