00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:51.280
Each line is the signature of a chemical element such as sodium, iron, calcium. It is this

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:56.360
array of lines forms the code which describes the properties and motion of a star.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.700
Narrowing the view of the sun to a single line of the spectrum,

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.730
